  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Buildings?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2f/Buildings.png/revision/latest?cb=20180510221138\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Buildings\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Buildings</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Buildings</b> are one of the main features of the game. It is where players can <a href=\"/wiki/storage-buildings-3569\" title=\"Storage Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">store</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">make</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/trade-3641\" title=\"Trade\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">trade</a> items, shelter <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">serve town visitors</a>.\n</p><p>Buildings can be found or placed on the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a>, in the <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a> or around the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing lake</a>.\n</p><p>The first building is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 1. The last building is unlocked at experience level 80.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying buildings</b></span></h3>\n<p>Buildings must generally be bought or repaired using <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a> (<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>) although some are given for free.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal shelters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production buildings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">service buildings</a> are bought in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a> <span><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"57\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n.\n</p><p>Players can generally only have one of each building, with a few exceptions (shelters notably).\n</p><p>Once bought and placed, buildings cannot be sold or stored.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading buildings</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/storage-buildings-3569\" title=\"Storage Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Storage Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/storage-buildings-3569\" title=\"Storage Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Storage buildings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">service buildings</a> can be upgraded using <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a>. Additional slots for <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production buildings</a> can be unlocked using <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> or, more rarely, <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a>.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>At the beginning of the game think carefully before you cut down trees or remove rocks on your farm. You will need increasing space for new buildings and supplies can be hard to get so try and clear areas which will give you as much space as possible.</li>\n<li>On the other hand keep in mind that 'natural' trees --as opposed to those bought in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a> as <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a>-- change with seasons, and that decorative rocks and ponds do not look like 'natural' ones.</li>\n<li>If you do not focus on leveling up quickly at first you will always have enough money by the time a new building is unlocked.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-farm-buildings-14843\" title=\"Category:Farm Buildings (30 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c2/Farmhouse.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20160215111547\" title=\"Category:Farm Buildings (30 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Category:Farm Buildings (30 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-town-buildings-15140\" title=\"Category:Town Buildings (528 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e6/Town_Hall.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191026015915\" title=\"Category:Town Buildings (528 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Category:Town Buildings (528 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-fishing-lake-buildings-23358\" title=\"Category:Fishing Lake Buildings (435 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b4/Fishing_Hut.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150712181819\" title=\"Category:Fishing Lake Buildings (435 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Category:Fishing Lake Buildings (435 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260828210707\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 140/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 849/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 141/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3835/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639533/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.940      1 -total\n 53.27%   17.015      1 Template:Infoicon\n 23.40%    7.473      1 Template:BuildingsMenu\n  5.21%    1.664      1 Template:Languages\n  4.56%    1.457      1 Template:Clr\n  4.50%    1.436      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  3.82%    1.221      1 Template:BigIcon\n  3.38%    1.080      3 Template:Main\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:3577-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260828210707 and revision id 106755. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
